iego Padres, and into the Historic Gaslamp Quarter, which after its reinvention is MUCH more family friendly then it used to be. As you leave the Gaslamp Quarter you will enter Banker’s Hill with is unique shops, also borders the always beautiful Balboa Park.\n\n**Tour Highlights:**\n\n- Little Italy\n- Maritime Museum\n- U.S.S. Midway\n- Seaport Village\n- Horton Plaza\n- Historic Gaslamp Quarter\n- Petco Park\n- Bankers Hill\n\n**Conditions:**\n\n- GoCars hold a maximum of 2 people. Prices are per GoCar, not per person.\n- Must be 21 years or older to rent. Must possess a major credit card and valid driver’s license (international license is not necessary). GoCars do not accommodate car seats for children.\n- On the day of rental, a security deposit will be held on your credit card until the GoCar is returned. All riders must sign a standard participant agreement. Renters will have the option to purchase Collision Damage Waiver (CDW) insurance on the day of rental.\n- Renters are free to extend the length of their tour on the day of rental. Additional rental time will be charged in 15-minute increments.\"", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "3918 Mason Street, San Diego, CA 92110", "booking_notes": "##Driver must be 21 years or older with a valid driver's license.\n\n##Please arrive at least 15 min before your scheduled departure time. \n\n-Parking is difficult in downtown San Diego sometimes so we always suggest taking an Uber or Lyft.\n\n-Departure times are approximated due to customers prior to your reservation possibly taking longer than they were booked for.\n\n- If you wish to keep your car longer than what you have booked for, you are welcome, but please check that it is available for you to keep and not needed by another renter. \n\n- Additional time is charged in 15 minute increments at our standard internet rates. \n\n- Please make sure you return the car before we close. Late returns are billed at $1 